We’re looking for a sharp and driven Senior SEO Specialist to join our team!
Requirements:
5+ years of SEO experience with proven successful cases;
2+ years in iGaming;
Strong understanding of search engine algorithms;
English level B1+, Ukrainian/Russian;
Experience in developing and executing SEO strategies (content, technical SEO, link building, UX);
